kairos Kokoro sidecar

This image contains Kokoro-82M model weights and voice packs from
https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M at revision
f3ff3571791e39611d31c381e3a41a3af07b4987, licensed under Apache-2.0.

The Kokoro inference library and Misaki grapheme-to-phoneme library are
Copyright their respective contributors and licensed under Apache-2.0.
The image also contains their locked transitive dependencies; package license
metadata is preserved in the Python environment under *.dist-info/licenses.

Kokoro output is generated locally. The model is not used for training or
voice cloning by kairos.
